# Keep notebook outputs out of git (see finding #18): training logs, host
# diagnostics and base64 images bloat diffs and leak environment details.
#
# Attributes only. The nbstripout filter must be registered once per clone:
#     pip install nbstripout && nbstripout --install
# which writes the [filter "nbstripout"] stanza into .git/config and keeps the
# attribute below pointing at it.
*.ipynb filter=nbstripout
*.ipynb diff=jupyter
